    <item>
      <title>TRADR experience</title>
      <link>https://spindro.github.io/post/tradr/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 17 Sep 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://spindro.github.io/post/tradr/</guid>
      <description>This is the first post of my personal page and in some sense, the story the beginning of my interest in research. I had the privilege to collaborate as a bachelor and later master student to an European project TRADR: Long-Term Human-Robot Teaming for Disaster Response. It has not been always easy to make this intern at the Alcor lab coexist with my ordinary studies, but was worth it. I&amp;rsquo;ve learned a lot of stuff, travelled as much and made new connections.</description>
